<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Standard Federal said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Standard Federal said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs cut its rating of Standard Federal Bank to a market perform from its prior rating of outperform, according to a Goldman source.</p>
<p>-- Shares were flat at 56-3/8.</p>
<p>-- Dutch bank ABN AMRO Holding NV said Friday it would pay $1.9 billion to buy Standard Federal, which owns the seventh-largest savings bank in the United States.</p>
</text>
